WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:03.970
- I was born in Bangladesh,
I grew up in U.S.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.803
I have lived in Chicago,
New York, Los Angeles.

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:08.541
I've been coming to Dubai for a while

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.690
to see the culture of Middle East.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.610
I like the diversity in
Dubai. It's a melting pot.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.330
And if I can do something astronomic

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.793
that is new and exciting
here, it's fulfilling.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
(techno rock music)

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:37.660
My names is Mohammad Islam. I am a cook.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.860
Now I live in Dubai. I was trained

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.610
in classic French cuisine.
I love French food.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.230
That's my passion.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.470
It is very easy to live
here, and I really like

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:49.600
the local people. They
are extremely humble.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.070
Dubai kind of drew me back here

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.420
due to the growth of the country.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.580
Plus, I like the diversity because we have

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.051
somewhere around 200 nationalities here.

00:00:59.051 --> 00:01:02.163
It's very hard to find
anywhere in the world.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.100
Atelier M is a creation between
the food and the design.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.910
So we use classic techniques
to create modern cuisine.

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:14.730
I have at least eight different
nationalities in the kitchen,

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.460
so when we sit down and brainstorm

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.050
putting together the culture,
diversity, we come up

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.360
with things that I would
never ever think about.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.890
And when you see food that's coming out

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:24.220
beautifully from the kitchen,

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.110
it's a great feeling; the synergy,

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:28.963
all the chefs working
together, it's like a family.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.033
One good thing in Dubai that you can get

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:35.190
everything from East as well as West.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.247
So I have Japan very close to me.

00:01:37.247 --> 00:01:40.165
I have Australia is not too
far, then I have entire Europe.

00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:43.960
For every chef I think
the produce, locally,

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.860
it's very, very important.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:50.113
And I think that's what gives
you the colors of our plate.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.750
I think my vision was right.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:58.610
Today Dubai is one of the
top food cities you can say.

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:00.410
Internationally recognized chefs are

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.850
in Dubai creating modern cuisine.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.680
There's plenty of great
restaurants all around Dubai,

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.030
which compete with the
rest of the world today.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:11.724
Why do I love food?

00:02:11.724 --> 00:02:13.850
I think food is everything.

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:16.090
Food is entangled with culture.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:18.933
Culture is society, and
society is all of us.

